@base = http://localhost:5106
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Get Alice's account (Accounts component)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

### Withdraw 100 €
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Transfer from Alice to Bob (Transfers component → calls the Accounts component)
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 250 }

### Bob's transfer history (stored in the Transfers component's database)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}/transfers
